00:00:43.699 --> 00:00:47.039
- And to practice success
before you're successful.

00:00:47.039 --> 00:00:49.891
One of the stories, and I
know Peter remembers it.

00:00:49.891 --> 00:00:52.080
Before I had any money, I
used to go to the Rolls Royce

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:56.027
dealers and sit in the
cars and smell the leather,

00:00:56.027 --> 00:00:58.059
