00:00:58.059 --> 00:00:59.220
In these days, this is 40 years ago,

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:01.388
I went to million dollar houses,

00:01:01.388 --> 00:01:04.537
and my wife and I would
walk through the house,

00:01:04.537 --> 00:01:06.999
and they'd say, "When are your
parents getting here, kids?"

00:01:06.999 --> 00:01:08.758
No, we are the buyers.

00:01:08.758 --> 00:01:09.689
Okay?

00:01:09.689 --> 00:01:10.708
And to get used to it.

00:01:10.708 --> 00:01:12.696
And that's reason the
castle is so effective.

00:01:12.696 --> 00:01:14.818
And the reason I stopped
giving outside seminars,

00:01:14.818 --> 00:01:18.985
is that the success rate is
almost five times greater

00:01:20.967 --> 00:01:24.915
going to the castle, having
a butler wait on you,

00:01:24.915 --> 00:01:27.526
dressing, thinking more of yourself.

00:01:27.526 --> 00:01:31.098
Because self-esteem is the
key to high performance.

00:01:31.098 --> 00:01:33.167
If we feel good about ourselves,

00:01:33.167 --> 00:01:34.846
and we hang around with people,

00:01:34.846 --> 00:01:38.386
the average of the five people
that we are mostly around,

00:01:38.386 --> 00:01:39.955
is who we turn out to be.

00:01:39.955 --> 00:01:44.708
Follow what you're passionate
about; what you love.

00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:48.167
It's not work if you love
what you're doing, okay?

00:01:48.167 --> 00:01:50.465
Most people, and I say
they're living quiet lives

00:01:50.465 --> 00:01:52.527
of desperation, is because
they're involved in a business

00:01:52.527 --> 00:01:55.917
and/or a job that they don't enjoy,

00:01:55.917 --> 00:01:57.716
they're not passionate about.

00:01:57.716 --> 00:02:00.884
So if you found something
that you're passionate about,

00:02:00.884 --> 00:02:03.167
it doesn't matter if you
work three hours a day

00:02:03.167 --> 00:02:06.035
or 13 hours a day, that's where you start.

00:02:06.035 --> 00:02:07.695
And most people aren't there.

00:02:07.695 --> 00:02:09.256
Most people have to find that.

00:02:09.256 --> 00:02:11.155
But does that look like your group?

00:02:11.155 --> 00:02:13.765
No, it doesn't look like your group.

00:02:13.765 --> 00:02:17.538
I mean, in no way shape, manner, or form.

00:02:17.538 --> 00:02:19.754
You know, maybe if we had
a bunch of bunny rabbits

00:02:19.754 --> 00:02:20.921
