00:02:23.316 --> 00:02:25.496
It's unbelievable.

00:02:25.496 --> 00:02:28.227
Again, you are who you
hang around with, you know.

00:02:28.227 --> 00:02:30.166
And as Oprah Winfrey says,

00:02:30.166 --> 00:02:32.654
